# Day 12 – Binary Tree Solutions (Java)

## 1. LeetCode #100 – Same Tree

**Problem:** Check whether two binary trees are identical in structure and node values.

**Concepts:** Recursion, Tree Traversal

```java
class Solution {
    public boolean isSameTree(TreeNode p, TreeNode q) {

        if (p == null && q == null) {
            return true;
        }

        if (p == null || q == null) {
            return false;
        }

        if (p.val != q.val) {
            return false;
        }

        return isSameTree(p.left, q.left) &&
               isSameTree(p.right, q.right);
    }
}
```

**Time Complexity:** O(n)  
**Space Complexity:** O(h), where h is the tree height.

